		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:evvngjxr223ucot6hmtiuzqy/app.bsky.feed.post/3meouwwbfz22z",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jacobberglund.com/post/3meouwwbfz22z",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jacob Berglund",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jacobberglund.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:evvngjxr223ucot6hmtiuzqy/bafkreibrreyxbd4cc25ilt4qxpzbh64yfxuwn4c4wmntruogl3mtj63shq"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-12T20:56:41.901Z",
			"content": "<p>Oooh, nice. I’d even italicize that nice were it possible. That nice.</p>\n<p>I’m all for this simplicity. Like, a form with a method=get and some view transitions goes a long way as well. Basically free niceness.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3meovzii5rk2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:wxp24sbnpwbgg5lkc7rfilas/app.bsky.feed.post/3meouqakp5c2n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3meovzii5rk2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-12T21:16:01.847Z",
			"content": "<p>yeah, that’s fair. There are some interaction tradeoffs happening, if folks are actively doing some &lt;form&gt; work you would want to warn before navigating away. Might also help to do some clever prefetching too. Looking forward to compression dictionaries which would help here too!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ceegour3qy5xsmnog56fgt5w/app.bsky.feed.post/3meoxe7awwc2f",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3meovzii5rk2m",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/polarbirke.bsky.social/post/3meoxe7awwc2f",
			"author": {
				"name": "Søren Birkemeyer",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/polarbirke.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ceegour3qy5xsmnog56fgt5w/bafkreihshoz7mygvxkajs7fiie4q64ziwyvpephkv2ufulinibejehjaii"
			},
			"date": "2026-02-12T21:39:55.012Z",
			"content": "<p>It‘s also all quite unexpected when you‘re following a screen reader, where 'invisible' details like “link menu“, the round-trips and page loads, etc. become more apparent.</p>\n<p>That said: All is fair in love and on personal pages. You can just do things!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		}
